*Heading
In-plane stiffness of a [30/-60/45]s laminate, S4R composite: three uniform strain states
** Every node gets the in-plane displacements of a uniform strain (eps_x, eps_y, gamma_xy = 1e-3, one step each); the
** thickness is free, so the reactions on the edges x = 1 and y = 1 are the laminate's A11 ... A66 times 1e-3.
